stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> INVESTIGATING: POST /incidents or an alert (gateway record)
  INVESTIGATING --> FAILED: agent unreachable or error
  INVESTIGATING --> AWAITING_APPROVAL: investigation + RCA + guardrails
  AWAITING_APPROVAL --> CLOSED_NO_ACTION: rejected
  AWAITING_APPROVAL --> ESCALATED: approved escalate (nothing to execute)
  AWAITING_APPROVAL --> REMEDIATING: approved action + capability
  REMEDIATING --> REMEDIATION_FAILED: no/refused capability or adapter error
  REMEDIATING --> RESOLVED: executed and verified healthy
  REMEDIATING --> REMEDIATION_FAILED: executed but still unhealthy
  RESOLVED --> [*]
  CLOSED_NO_ACTION --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  note right of AWAITING_APPROVAL: second decision → 409 (single use)
  note right of REMEDIATION_FAILED: stays open (alert linked), a human takes over
